  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あいてを　いちげきで　うちまかすほど\nパワフルだが　わすれっぽいので\nたたかっている　あいてを　わすれる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "상대를 일격에 쓰러뜨릴 정도로\n파워풀하지만 건망증이 심해서\n싸우고 있는 상대를 잊어버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雖然擁有一擊定勝負的威力，\n但因為記性實在太差，\n對戰還沒結束就會忘記對手是誰。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est assez puissant pour terrasser un ennemi\nd’un seul coup, mais il est tellement nigaud\nqu’il oublie contre qui il se bat.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist so stark, dass es seine Gegner mit einem\nAngriff vernichten könnte, aber zerstreut wie es\nist, vergisst es öfters, wen es gerade bekämpft.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su colosal potencia le permite machacar al rival\nde un solo golpe, aunque su carácter despistado\nlo lleva a olvidarse de su presencia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È così potente che può sconfiggere l’avversario\nin un colpo solo, ma è talmente smemorato che\nsi dimentica perfino con chi stava lottando.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s so strong that it can knock out some\nopponents in a single hit, but it also may\nforget what it’s battling midfight.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "相手を　一撃で　打ち負かすほど\nパワフルだが　忘れっぽいので\n戦っている　相手を　忘れる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "虽然拥有一击定胜负的威力，\n由于记性实在太差，\n对战还没结束就会忘记对手是谁。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su colosal potencia le permite machacar al rival\nde un solo golpe, aunque su carácter despistado\nlo lleva a olvidarse de su presencia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "くいしんぼうで　エサの　サシカマスを\nまるのみするが　たまに　まちがえて\nほかの　ポケモンに　くらいつく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "먹보이다. 먹이인 찌로꼬치를\n통째로 삼키지만 가끔 실수로\n다른 포켓몬을 먹어버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "非常貪吃，會把刺梭魚整隻\n吞進嘴裡。偶爾也會搞錯對象\n去咬其他的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Très glouton, il avale les Embrochet d’une seule\nbouchée, mais il lui arrive de se tromper\net de tenter de gober un autre Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist ein Vielfraß, der seine Beute, Pikuda,\nim Ganzen verschlingt. Manchmal erwischt es\njedoch irrtümlicherweise ein anderes Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Traga Arrokuda enteros debido a su glotonería,\ntan notable que en ocasiones ingiere hasta otros\nPokémon sin querer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È molto ingordo e ingoia tutti interi gli Arrokuda\ndi cui si nutre. A volte ingoia anche altri\nPokémon per sbaglio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This hungry Pokémon swallows Arrokuda whole.\nOccasionally, it makes a mistake and tries to\nswallow a Pokémon other than its preferred prey.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "食いしん坊で　エサの　サシカマスを\n丸飲みするが　たまに　間違えて\nほかの　ポケモンに　食らいつく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "非常贪吃，会把刺梭鱼整只\n吞进嘴里。偶尔也会搞错对象\n去咬其他的宝可梦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Traga Arrokuda enteros debido a su glotonería,\ntan notable que en ocasiones ingiere hasta otros\nPokémon sin querer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "なんでも　まるのみする　しゅうせい。おおきすぎる　えものを　つまらせてこまっている　ウッウほど　てごわい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "무엇이든 통째로 삼키는 습성이 있다. 지나치게 큰 먹이를 삼켜서 버거워하는 윽우지일수록 강하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "擁有大口吞下任何東西的習性。越是為著喉嚨卡的過大獵物而煩惱的古月鳥，越是難以對付。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les Nigosier avalent tout en une bouchée. Ils sont particulièrement redoutables lorsqu’ils se démènent pour gober une proie trop grosse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es hat die Angewohnheit, alles in einem Stück zu verschlingen. Je mehr es damit ringt, übergroße Beute runterzuschlucken, desto zäher wird es.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tiene por costumbre engullir todo de un bocado. Es más temible cuando está intentando ingerir una presa demasiado grande.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha l’abitudine di inghiottire tutto in un boccone. Più grande è la fatica che fa per ingoiare una preda troppo grossa, più temibile diventa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cramorant instinctively swallow everything whole. They’re at their most formidable when they’re struggling to swallow overly large prey.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "なんでも　丸飲みする　習性。大きすぎる　獲物を　詰まらせて困っている　ウッウほど　手強い。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "拥有将什么东西都一口吞下的习性。越是为喉咙卡住过大猎物而烦恼的古月鸟就越难对付。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tiene por costumbre engullir todo de un bocado. Es más temible cuando está intentando ingerir una presa demasiado grande.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ものおぼえは　わるすぎだが　のうにつかう　エネルギーを　ぎりぎりにしてそのぶんを　たたかいに　まわすのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "기억력이 아주 나쁘다. 뇌에 사용할 에너지를 최소한으로 남기고 나머지는 싸움에 활용하기 때문이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "記性差到不行，但其實是只留了最低限度的能量給大腦，把大部分能量都用在戰鬥上。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a une très mauvaise mémoire, car il consacre l’essentiel de son énergie au combat. Il n’utilise que le strict minimum pour alimenter son cerveau.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein Gedächtnis ist schlecht, aber indem es so wenig Energie wie möglich für sein Gehirn nutzt, kann es sie stattdessen zum Kämpfen verwenden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si bien es sumamente desmemoriado, reducir al mínimo indispensable la energía que suministra al cerebro le permite destinar el resto al combate.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È molto smemorato, ma limitando al minimo l’energia usata per il cervello può destinarne una maggiore quantità alla lotta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s an incredibly poor learner because it uses the bare minimum amount of energy for its brain. It focuses on battling instead.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "物覚えは　悪すぎだが　脳に使う　エネルギーを　ぎりぎりにしてそのぶんを　戦いに　回すのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "记性相当差，会把大部分能量分配在战斗上，只留最低限度的能量给大脑。",
